EXCEPT AS EXPRESSLY PROVIDED IN A CONTROLLING WRITTEN AGREEMENT, THE MATERIALS
ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE," WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND,
